message: If you use this software, please cite BioDataLink and the original datasets.
type: software
title: BioDataLink
abstract: >-
  A Wolfram Language paclet for discovering biological datasets, inspecting
  provider metadata, and importing data with explicit identifiers and provenance.
authors:
